Shopping at a French market? Say THIS 🍎🇫🇷

• un kilo de = a kilo of
• et avec ça ? = anything else?
• c'est un peu cher = it's a bit expensive
• bio = organic
• je les prends = I'll take them

🍎 Which fruit would you buy? Comment "Je voudrais des ___" 👇
💌 Save this for your market trip
👯 Send it to a friend who loves French markets

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

